+The Fluent SDK (`@servicenow/sdk` 4.14.2, flow plugin `@servicenow/fluent-flow` 1.1.9-alpha.1) writes the same records this prompt writes. Its source (readable in the package's `sdk-api/dist/external-plugins/flow.js.map`) was compared with this prompt on 2026-11-19. These rules are confirmed twice: by ServiceNow's code and by the import and runtime tests here.
+
+| Rule in this prompt | What the SDK source does |
+|---|---|
+| `sys_hub_flow.version` is `2` | Constant `FLOW_VERSION = '2'` |
+| Only the `_v2` instance tables | Writes `sys_hub_trigger_instance_v2`, `sys_hub_action_instance_v2`, `sys_hub_flow_logic_instance_v2`, `sys_hub_sub_flow_instance_v2` |
